{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03202","headline":"和郑雠校内省眺瞩思乡怀友 · 杨炯","name":"和郑雠校内省眺瞩思乡怀友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铜门初下辟，石馆始沈研。\n游雾千金字，飞云五色牋。\n楼台横紫极，城阙俯青田。\n暄入瑶房里，春回玉宇前。\n霞文埋落照，风物澹归烟。\n翰墨三余隙，关山四望悬。\n颓峰暌酌羽，流水旷鸣弦。\n虽欣承白雪，终恨隔青天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03202.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03202","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}